That connects Atlas, Semantic Router, Seals, O-IOE, TISS, Golden Thread, Delta Calculus, and Reality Stitch in one functional layer.

The substantive Aug. 31 advance is therefore:

\boxed{
Pantheon\ moves\ from\ multi\text{-}representation\ reasoning
\rightarrow
multi\text{-}protocol\ state\ reconstruction.
}

The repository still does not contain the software implementation, but the architecture is now specified clearly enough that one can be built without inventing the core design. 